        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.152,
            0.834,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": "1. Draw a rectangle with sides of length 4 cm and 6 cm. After drawing, check if it satisfies both the rectangle properties."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.2,
            0.835,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "2. Draw a rectangle of sides 2 cm and 10 cm. After drawing, check if it satisfies both the rectangle properties."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.249,
            0.713,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "3. Is it possible to construct a 4-sided figure in which—"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.273,
            0.563,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": "• all the angles are equal to $9 0 ^ { \\circ }$ but"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.297,
            0.519,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": "opposite sides are not equal?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.789,
